  ('c241ccc1-cda1-5a88-bc52-e424a544cb6f', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g12-writing-with-evidence'), null, 'medium',
   $q$What is the main function of sentence 7 in the draft?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It explains how the slower early miles in sentence 6 connect to the claim about starting too fast.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It raises a possible objection to Mthembu's argument for the reader to consider.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misidentifies-counterclaim"},{"text":"It summarizes the whole draft before the writer turns to a new topic.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"premature-conclusion"},{"text":"It introduces a new statistic about where most runners drop out of the race.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-purpose"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It explains how the slower early miles in sentence 6 connect to the claim about starting too fast.$q$, $q$Sentence 6 gives the numbers, and sentence 7 explains what they mean: holding back early saved energy for the end, which is Mthembu's claim. The objection appears in sentence 8, not sentence 7.$q$, 'draft', '8fa8f357-fefe-5276-8bda-5e42f95a881d')
